---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
	lang="es"
	title="Club Cariblue: Cada visita suma | Cariblue Resort"
	description="Únete gratis a Club Cariblue, suma puntos en nuestros tres restaurantes y recibe $20 de cashback por cada noche que reserves directamente con Cariblue."
>
	<main class="bg-white text-[#0f2e59] leading-[1.65]" id="contenido">
		<section class="px-0 pt-45 pb-[58px] bg-[linear-gradient(115deg,_#0f2e59,_var(--color-primary))] text-white max-[720px]:pt-[125px] max-[720px]:pb-[35px]">
			<div
				class="m-auto px-9 py-0 max-w-320 grid grid-cols-[1fr_1.04fr] gap-13 items-center max-[980px]:px-[25px] max-[980px]:gap-[30px] max-[720px]:px-5 max-[720px]:grid-cols-1 max-[720px]:gap-5"
			>
				<div class="px-0 py-[26px] max-[720px]:pt-3 max-[720px]:pb-[5px]">
					<nav class="flex flex-wrap gap-5 mb-8 text-[12px] text-[#dbeafe] max-[720px]:gap-4 max-[720px]:text-[11px]" aria-label="Secciones de Club Cariblue">
						<a
							class="no-underline hover:underline focus-visible:outline-3 focus-visible:outline-solid focus-visible:outline-accent focus-visible:outline-offset-[5px]"
							href="#beneficios">Beneficios</a
						><a
							class="no-underline hover:underline focus-visible:outline-3 focus-visible:outline-solid focus-visible:outline-accent focus-visible:outline-offset-[5px]"
							href="#restaurantes">Restaurantes</a
						><a
							class="no-underline hover:underline focus-visible:outline-3 focus-visible:outline-solid focus-visible:outline-accent focus-visible:outline-offset-[5px]"
							href="#preguntas">Preguntas</a
						>
					</nav>
					<span class="mx-0 block text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[2.2px] uppercase mt-0 mb-[18px] text-[#eff6ff]">El Caribe tiene sus recompensas</span>
					<h1 class="mt-0 font-semibold leading-[1.15] text-[clamp(44px,_5.2vw,_72px)] mb-6 max-[380px]:text-[40px]">
						Club Cariblue:<br />cada visita<br /><em class="text-[#dbeafe]">suma.</em>
					</h1>
					<p class="mt-0 mb-5 max-w-120 text-[#eff6ff] text-[16px] max-[720px]:max-w-full">
						Disfrutá más de lo que te gusta. Sumá puntos en nuestros tres restaurantes y recibí <strong>$20 de cashback por cada noche</strong> que reservés directamente con nosotros.
					</p>
					<div class="flex gap-3 flex-wrap">
						<a
							class="join px-6 py-[13px] border border-transparent no-underline inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-[14px] min-h-13 rounded bg-accent text-white font-bold text-[13px] cursor-pointer transition-[background] duration-200 ease-[ease] max-[380px]:w-full motion-reduce:transition-none hover:bg-[#bd0055] focus-visible:outline-3 focus-visible:outline-solid focus-visible:outline-accent focus-visible:outline-offset-[5px]"
							href="https://wa.me/50683141965?text=Hola%2C%20quiero%20unirme%20al%20Club%20Cariblue.%20%C2%BFMe%20comparten%20el%20enlace%20de%20registro%3F"
							>Unite gratis <span class="text-[21px] font-normal leading-none" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
						><a
							class="px-6 py-[13px] border border-[#ffffff80] no-underline inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-[14px] min-h-13 rounded bg-transparent text-white font-bold text-[13px] cursor-pointer transition-[background] duration-200 ease-[ease] max-[380px]:w-full motion-reduce:transition-none hover:bg-[#ffffff15] focus-visible:outline-3 focus-visible:outline-solid focus-visible:outline-accent focus-visible:outline-offset-[5px]"
							href="/booking?lang=es">Reservá directo</a
						>
					</div>
					<p class="mx-0 mt-[19px] mb-0 text-[12px] leading-[1.65] text-[#eff6ff]">Gratis, fácil y sin necesidad de hospedarte.</p>
				</div>
				<div
					class="relative min-h-[570px] rounded-[100px_12px_12px_12px] overflow-hidden max-[980px]:min-h-130 max-[980px]:h-130 max-[720px]:min-h-95 max-[720px]:rounded-[65px_8px_8px_8px] max-[720px]:h-95 min-[1400px]:min-h-155 after:inset-0 after:content-[''] after:absolute after:bg-[linear-gradient(transparent_55%,_#0f2e59b3)]"
				>
					<img
						class="block w-full h-[570px] object-cover object-[47%_center] max-[980px]:h-130 max-[980px]:min-h-130 max-[720px]:h-95 max-[720px]:min-h-95 min-[1400px]:h-155"
						src="/club-cariblue-piscina.webp"
						alt="Piscina de Cariblue rodeada de jardines tropicales"
						width="886"
						height="900"
						fetchpriority="high"
					/>
					<div
						class="p-[25px] absolute top-11 right-6 w-[235px] bg-[#0f2e59] text-white rounded-xl z-2 shadow-[0_15px_40px_#0f2e5933] rotate-5 max-[980px]:p-5 max-[980px]:right-[15px] max-[980px]:w-[195px] max-[720px]:top-[25px] max-[720px]:right-5 max-[720px]:w-50"
						role="img"
						aria-label="Representación ilustrativa de la tarjeta digital Club Cariblue"
					>
						<span class="text-[10px] tracking-[2px] uppercase opacity-80">Tu tarjeta digital</span>
						<div class="mx-0 font-serif text-[31px] leading-[1.1] mt-[17px] mb-6 max-[980px]:text-[27px]">Club<br />Cariblue</div>
						<div class="border-t border-t-[#ffffff40] pt-[14px] text-[11px] flex items-center justify-between">
							<span>Disfrutá. Sumá. Volvé.</span><span class="text-[28px] text-[#dbeafe]" aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="absolute bottom-[30px] left-[30px] right-[30px] z-1 text-white text-[11px] tracking-[1px] max-[720px]:bottom-5 max-[720px]:left-[22px]">
						PLAYA COCLES · PUERTO VIEJO · COSTA RICA
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
		<div class="border-b border-b-[#e2e8f0] bg-[#f8fafc]">
			<div
				class="m-auto px-9 py-6 max-w-320 grid grid-cols-3 text-center text-[12px] max-[980px]:px-[25px] max-[720px]:px-5 max-[720px]:py-4 max-[720px]:grid-cols-1 max-[720px]:text-left max-[720px]:gap-3"
			>
				<strong class="font-semibold"><span class="text-accent mr-2" aria-hidden="true">✓</span> Inscripción gratuita</strong><strong
					class="font-semibold border-l border-l-[#e2e8f0] max-[720px]:border-0"><span class="text-accent mr-2" aria-hidden="true">✓</span> Tres restaurantes para sumar</strong
				><strong class="font-semibold border-l border-l-[#e2e8f0] max-[720px]:border-0"><span class="text-accent mr-2" aria-hidden="true">✓</span> Tu tarjeta, en el celular</strong
				>
			</div>
		</div>
		<section class="px-0 py-22 max-[980px]:py-18 max-[720px]:py-[55px]" id="como-funciona">
			<div class="m-auto px-9 py-0 max-w-320 max-[980px]:px-[25px] max-[720px]:px-5">
				<div class="flex justify-between gap-10 items-end mb-11 max-[720px]:block max-[720px]:mb-[30px]">
					<div>
						<span class="mx-0 block text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[2.2px] uppercase mt-0 mb-[18px] text-accent">Así de sencillo</span>
						<h2 class="my-0 font-semibold leading-[1.15] text-[clamp(32px,_3.6vw,_48px)] max-w-135">Disfrutar tiene<br />sus recompensas.</h2>
					</div>
					<p class="my-0 max-w-[365px] text-[#475569] text-[16px] max-[720px]:mt-5 max-[720px]:max-w-full max-[720px]:text-[15px]">
						De tu primer registro a tu próximo premio. Cada visita es una nueva oportunidad para disfrutar más.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-[45px] max-[720px]:grid-cols-1 max-[720px]:gap-[30px]">
					<article class="border-t border-t-[#cbd5e1] pt-[22px] max-[720px]:relative max-[720px]:pl-[63px]">
						<span class="font-serif text-[38px] text-primary block leading-none mb-[27px] max-[720px]:text-[33px] max-[720px]:absolute max-[720px]:top-6 max-[720px]:left-0"
							>01</span
						>
						<h3 class="mt-0 text-[21px] leading-[1.35] max-[720px]:text-[20px] max-[720px]:mb-[10px]">Unite gratis</h3>
						<p class="my-0 text-[#475569] text-[14px]">
							Registrate en minutos y guardá tu tarjeta digital en Apple Wallet o Google Wallet. Sin descargar aplicaciones adicionales.
						</p>
						<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-[7px] mt-[18px]">
							<span class="px-[9px] py-[5px] border border-[#e2e8f0] text-[11px] rounded">Apple Wallet</span><span
								class="px-[9px] py-[5px] border border-[#e2e8f0] text-[11px] rounded">Google Wallet</span
							>
						</div>
					</article>
					<article class="border-t border-t-[#cbd5e1] pt-[22px] max-[720px]:relative max-[720px]:pl-[63px]">
						<span class="font-serif text-[38px] text-primary block leading-none mb-[27px] max-[720px]:text-[33px] max-[720px]:absolute max-[720px]:top-6 max-[720px]:left-0"
							>02</span
						>
						<h3 class="mt-0 text-[21px] leading-[1.35] max-[720px]:text-[20px] max-[720px]:mb-[10px]">Sumá puntos</h3>
						<p class="my-0 text-[#475569] text-[14px]">Presentá tu tarjeta al pagar en La Jungla, Sushi Wave o Beach Break. <strong>Cada ₡200 de consumo suma 1 punto.</strong></p>
					</article>
					<article class="border-t border-t-[#cbd5e1] pt-[22px] max-[720px]:relative max-[720px]:pl-[63px]">
						<span class="font-serif text-[38px] text-primary block leading-none mb-[27px] max-[720px]:text-[33px] max-[720px]:absolute max-[720px]:top-6 max-[720px]:left-0"
							>03</span
						>
						<h3 class="mt-0 text-[21px] leading-[1.35] max-[720px]:text-[20px] max-[720px]:mb-[10px]">Disfrutá tus premios</h3>
						<p class="my-0 text-[#475569] text-[14px]">Acumulá puntos, canjeá recompensas y aprovechá las promociones exclusivas para miembros del Club.</p>
					</article>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
		<section id="cashback" aria-labelledby="cashback-title">
			<div class="m-auto px-9 py-0 max-w-320 max-[980px]:px-[25px] max-[720px]:px-5">
				<div
					class="p-15 bg-[#0f2e59] text-white rounded-xl grid grid-cols-[1.15fr_1fr] gap-15 items-center max-[980px]:p-[42px] max-[980px]:gap-[35px] max-[720px]:px-[25px] max-[720px]:py-[35px] max-[720px]:rounded-lg max-[720px]:grid-cols-1 max-[720px]:gap-[30px]"
				>
					<div>
						<span class="mx-0 block text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[2.2px] uppercase mt-0 mb-[18px] text-[#dbeafe]">Tu reserva directa vale más</span>
						<h2 class="mt-0 font-semibold leading-[1.15] text-[clamp(32px,_3.6vw,_48px)] mb-[22px] max-w-120" id="cashback-title">$20 de vuelta<br />por cada noche.</h2>
						<p class="mt-0 mb-5 text-[#dbeafe]">
							Reservá directamente con Cariblue y recibí cashback para disfrutar durante tu estadía en el resort. Más noches, más beneficios para vivir el Caribe.
						</p>
						<a
							class="px-6 py-[13px] border border-transparent no-underline inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-[14px] min-h-13 rounded bg-white text-[#0f2e59] font-bold text-[13px] cursor-pointer transition-[background] duration-200 ease-[ease] motion-reduce:transition-none hover:bg-[#dbeafe] focus-visible:outline-3 focus-visible:outline-solid focus-visible:outline-accent focus-visible:outline-offset-[5px]"
							href="/booking?lang=es">Reservá directo <span class="text-[21px] font-normal leading-none" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
						>
						<p class="mx-0 mt-[22px] mb-0 text-[12px] leading-[1.65] text-[#dbeafe] max-w-[475px]">
							Beneficio para socios Club Cariblue en reservas directas por web, WhatsApp o teléfono. Consultá la vigencia y las condiciones de la promoción al reservar.
						</p>
					</div>
					<div
						class="px-[25px] py-3 text-center border-l border-l-[#ffffff30] max-[980px]:p-[10px] max-[720px]:pt-[30px] max-[720px]:border-l-0 max-[720px]:border-t max-[720px]:border-t-[#ffffff30]"
					>
						<div class="font-serif text-[clamp(95px,_11vw,_145px)] leading-none tracking-[-6px] text-[#dbeafe] max-[720px]:text-[110px]">$20</div>
						<p class="mx-0 mt-[15px] mb-[30px] text-[#dbeafe] text-[12px] tracking-[1px] max-[720px]:mb-[22px]">DE CASHBACK POR NOCHE</p>
						<div class="border-t border-t-[#ffffff30] pt-[25px] grid grid-cols-3 gap-[14px]">
							<div><span class="text-[11px] text-[#dbeafe] block">1 noche</span><strong class="block text-[25px] font-normal text-white">$20</strong></div>
							<div><span class="text-[11px] text-[#dbeafe] block">2 noches</span><strong class="block text-[25px] font-normal text-white">$40</strong></div>
							<div><span class="text-[11px] text-[#dbeafe] block">3 noches</span><strong class="block text-[25px] font-normal text-white">$60</strong></div>
						</div>
						<p class="mx-0 mt-5 mb-0 text-[#dbeafe] text-[10px] tracking-normal">Ejemplos de cálculo para reservas elegibles.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
		<section class="px-0 py-22 max-[980px]:py-18 max-[720px]:py-[55px]" id="beneficios">
			<div class="m-auto px-9 py-0 max-w-320 max-[980px]:px-[25px] max-[720px]:px-5">
				<div class="flex justify-between gap-10 items-end mb-11 max-[720px]:block max-[720px]:mb-[30px]">
					<div>
						<span class="mx-0 block text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[2.2px] uppercase mt-0 mb-[18px] text-accent">Ser parte tiene sus ventajas</span>
						<h2 class="my-0 font-semibold leading-[1.15] text-[clamp(32px,_3.6vw,_48px)] max-w-135">Más razones<br />para volver.</h2>
					</div>
					<p class="my-0 max-w-[365px] text-[#475569] text-[16px] max-[720px]:mt-5 max-[720px]:max-w-full max-[720px]:text-[15px]">
						Un almuerzo, una cena frente al mar o tu próxima escapada. Lo que disfrutás hoy puede sumar para tu siguiente visita.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-[18px] max-[720px]:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr] max-[720px]:gap-3 max-[380px]:grid-cols-1">
					<article class="p-7 border border-[#e2e8f0] bg-white rounded-lg max-[720px]:px-[17px] max-[720px]:py-[21px]">
						<div class="w-[42px] h-[42px] bg-[#eff6ff] text-primary rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-[25px] max-[720px]:mb-[17px]" aria-hidden="true">
							<svg class="w-[23px] h-[23px] fill-none stroke-current stroke-[1.5] [stroke-linecap:round] [stroke-linejoin:round]" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
								><path d="M3 10h18v4H3zM5 14v7h14v-7M12 10v11M12 10H7a3 3 0 1 1 3-3l2 3Zm0 0h5a3 3 0 1 0-3-3l-2 3Z"></path></svg
							>
						</div>
						<h3 class="mt-0 text-[18px] leading-[1.35] mb-[10px] max-[720px]:text-[16px]">Bienvenida con beneficio</h3>
						<p class="my-0 text-[14px] text-[#475569] max-[720px]:text-[13px]">
							Disfrutá un <strong>10% de descuento en tu primera compra en restaurantes.</strong> Un cupón válido por tiempo limitado; no aplica a promociones.
						</p>
					</article>
					<article class="p-7 border border-[#e2e8f0] bg-white rounded-lg max-[720px]:px-[17px] max-[720px]:py-[21px]">
						<div class="w-[42px] h-[42px] bg-[#eff6ff] text-primary rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-[25px] max-[720px]:mb-[17px]" aria-hidden="true">
							<svg class="w-[23px] h-[23px] fill-none stroke-current stroke-[1.5] [stroke-linecap:round] [stroke-linejoin:round]" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
								><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="m12 6 1.7 3.5 3.8.6-2.8 2.7.7 3.8-3.4-1.8-3.4 1.8.7-3.8-2.8-2.7 3.8-.6Z"></path></svg
							>
						</div>
						<h3 class="mt-0 text-[18px] leading-[1.35] mb-[10px] max-[720px]:text-[16px]">Puntos por consumo</h3>
						<p class="my-0 text-[14px] text-[#475569] max-[720px]:text-[13px]">Cada ₡1 suma 1 punto. Mostrá tu tarjeta al pagar y seguí acercándote a tu próxima recompensa.</p>
					</article>
					<article class="p-7 border border-[#e2e8f0] bg-white rounded-lg max-[720px]:px-[17px] max-[720px]:py-[21px]">
						<div class="w-[42px] h-[42px] bg-[#eff6ff] text-primary rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-[25px] max-[720px]:mb-[17px]" aria-hidden="true">
							<svg class="w-[23px] h-[23px] fill-none stroke-current stroke-[1.5] [stroke-linecap:round] [stroke-linejoin:round]" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
								><path d="M4 5h16v15H4zM8 3v4M16 3v4M4 10h16m-12 5 3 3 5-5"></path></svg
							>
						</div>
						<h3 class="mt-0 text-[18px] leading-[1.35] mb-[10px] max-[720px]:text-[16px]">Beneficios por visita</h3>
						<p class="my-0 text-[14px] text-[#475569] max-[720px]:text-[13px]">
							Volver tiene premio. Descubrí los beneficios que podés desbloquear al seguir visitando nuestros restaurantes.
						</p>
					</article>
					<article class="p-7 border border-[#e2e8f0] bg-white rounded-lg max-[720px]:px-[17px] max-[720px]:py-[21px]">
						<div class="w-[42px] h-[42px] bg-[#eff6ff] text-primary rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-[25px] max-[720px]:mb-[17px]" aria-hidden="true">
							<svg class="w-[23px] h-[23px] fill-none stroke-current stroke-[1.5] [stroke-linecap:round] [stroke-linejoin:round]" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
								><path d="M5 4h14v5a7 7 0 0 1-14 0ZM5 6H2v3a4 4 0 0 0 5 4M19 6h3v3a4 4 0 0 1-5 4M12 16v5M7 21h10"></path></svg
							>
						</div>
						<h3 class="mt-0 text-[18px] leading-[1.35] mb-[10px] max-[720px]:text-[16px]">Canje de premios</h3>
						<p class="my-0 text-[14px] text-[#475569] max-[720px]:text-[13px]">
							Convertí tus puntos en consumos y recompensas del catálogo del Club. Elegí tu siguiente motivo para visitarnos.
						</p>
					</article>
					<article class="p-7 border border-[#e2e8f0] bg-white rounded-lg max-[720px]:px-[17px] max-[720px]:py-[21px]">
						<div class="w-[42px] h-[42px] bg-[#eff6ff] text-primary rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-[25px] max-[720px]:mb-[17px]" aria-hidden="true">
							<svg class="w-[23px] h-[23px] fill-none stroke-current stroke-[1.5] [stroke-linecap:round] [stroke-linejoin:round]" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
								><path d="m3 3 9 1 9 9-8 8-9-9Z"></path><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="1.5"></circle></svg
							>
						</div>
						<h3 class="mt-0 text-[18px] leading-[1.35] mb-[10px] max-[720px]:text-[16px]">Promociones exclusivas</h3>
						<p class="my-0 text-[14px] text-[#475569] max-[720px]:text-[13px]">Accedé a promociones especiales para miembros y disfrutá los beneficios vigentes del Club.</p>
					</article>
					<article class="p-7 border border-[#dbeafe] bg-[#eff6ff] rounded-lg max-[720px]:px-[17px] max-[720px]:py-[21px]">
						<div class="w-[42px] h-[42px] bg-white text-accent rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-[25px] max-[720px]:mb-[17px]" aria-hidden="true">
							<svg class="w-[23px] h-[23px] fill-none stroke-current stroke-[1.5] [stroke-linecap:round] [stroke-linejoin:round]" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
								><path d="M3 5h18v14H3zM3 9h18M7 15h3m5 0 2-2 2 2m-2-2v4"></path></svg
							>
						</div>
						<h3 class="mt-0 text-[18px] leading-[1.35] mb-[10px] max-[720px]:text-[16px]">Cashback por noche</h3>
						<p class="my-0 text-[14px] text-[#475569] max-[720px]:text-[13px]">
							Recibí $20 de cashback por cada noche de una reserva directa elegible. Tus vacaciones también suman.
						</p>
					</article>
				</div>
				<p class="mt-[18px] mb-0 text-[12px] leading-[1.65] text-[#475569]">
					Los beneficios, premios y promociones están sujetos a sus respectivas condiciones de uso y disponibilidad.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>
		<section class="px-0 py-22 bg-[#f8fafc] max-[980px]:py-18 max-[720px]:py-[55px]" id="restaurantes">
			<div class="m-auto px-9 py-0 max-w-320 max-[980px]:px-[25px] max-[720px]:px-5">
				<div class="flex justify-between gap-10 items-end mb-11 max-[720px]:block max-[720px]:mb-[30px]">
					<div>
						<span class="mx-0 block text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[2.2px] uppercase mt-0 mb-[18px] text-accent">Elegí tu próximo antojo</span>
						<h2 class="my-0 font-semibold leading-[1.15] text-[clamp(32px,_3.6vw,_48px)] max-w-135">Tres restaurantes.<br />Un mismo Club.</h2>
					</div>
					<p class="my-0 max-w-[365px] text-[#475569] text-[16px] max-[720px]:mt-5 max-[720px]:max-w-full max-[720px]:text-[15px]">
						Sabores caribeños, cocina Nikkei y tus favoritos de sport bar. Muchas formas de disfrutar y seguir sumando.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-[26px] max-[720px]:grid-cols-1 max-[720px]:gap-[38px]">
					<article class="flex flex-col">
						<img
							class="block w-full h-[275px] rounded-lg object-cover mb-6 max-[980px]:h-[225px] max-[720px]:h-[290px] max-[720px]:mb-[19px]"
							src="/club-cariblue-la-jungla.webp"
							alt="Platos servidos para compartir en La Jungla"
							loading="lazy"
							width="850"
